description: Never add AI agent attribution to git commits or PR bodies in this repo.
alwaysApply: true
---

# No AI agent git attribution

- Do not add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Claude`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or `Claude-Session:` to commits or PR descriptions.
- Use plain commit messages only; do not use `git commit --trailer` for agents.
- Repo hooks strip agent trailers on commit; CI fails pushes/PRs that include them.
